__pycache__
dist/
tent_pole.egg-info/
.doit.db

## Generated build products under each dev/sample-course-*/ (see each
## one's README.md) -- source and Markdown are tracked, these are
## rebuilt by `make`/`tent-pole build`. No secret lives in any of
## these directories: tent-pole.toml only has [module], and the real
## target/credentials come from TENT_POLE_USE_TEST_CONFIG + your own
## global tent-pole.toml's [dev] section. ** matches zero or more
## directories, so this covers both a flat sample course and one with
## nested module directories (dev/sample-course-java/) alike.
dev/sample-course-*/**/*.html
dev/sample-course-*/**/*.tpp
dev/sample-course-*/**/*.tpf
dev/sample-course-*/**/*.tpd
dev/sample-course-*/**/*.tpq
dev/sample-course-*/**/*.out
dev/sample-course-*/**/*.stout
dev/sample-course-*/**/*.crash

## Course-specific extras, not shared by the pattern above.
dev/sample-course-python/test-image.png
dev/sample-course-python/test-video.mp4
dev/sample-course-r/*.png
dev/sample-course-r/tent-pole.toml.tpm
